                            w::r = [
                                w::t = "The AVP CUG is configured for Y-copy meaning all HVCS payment messages are sent in Y-copy mode. Y-copy mode requires a portion of the payment message to be sent to the RBNZ to authorise or refuse its delivery to the recipient. Payment messages are only delivered to the recipients once they have been authorised, and typically once settlement of the HVCS payment has been made within RTGS."
                            ]
